WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
The info blocks and timers do a lot of the work for you.

2
00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:09.679
set life shows hearts, and at zero lives the game ends by itself.

3
00:00:10.484 --> 00:00:15.059
A timer runs its blocks again every second, so it can make enemies.

4
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:22.283
An overlap runs every frame, so destroy the enemy when it hits.
